WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.850 --> 01:31.150
[My Journey to You]

01:31.180 --> 01:34.120
[Episode 17]

01:50.270 --> 01:51.930
Is the golden gentian enough?

01:54.140 --> 01:54.789
Yes.

01:55.770 --> 01:57.240
Lady Wuji gave me a lot.

01:58.420 --> 02:00.350
I was afraid there will be scarring

02:00.610 --> 02:01.840
and you won't like it.

02:03.590 --> 02:06.000
You could have just asked me for it directly.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.050
It's just a herb.

02:07.960 --> 02:10.960
There was no need for you to compromise and apologize.

02:12.580 --> 02:14.180
I didn't have to compromise.

02:16.890 --> 02:17.410
Really?

02:30.750 --> 02:33.000
I know you still suspect Lady Wuji.

02:34.130 --> 02:36.790
That's why I went to fix my relationship with her

02:37.030 --> 02:39.050
so that it'd be easier for me to help you

02:39.050 --> 02:40.050
investigate her.

02:45.660 --> 02:46.460
Is it for me

02:48.170 --> 02:49.240
or for yourself?

02:53.460 --> 02:54.790
Doing something for you

02:56.440 --> 02:58.770
is the same as doing something for myself.

02:58.820 --> 02:59.800
You and I

03:00.580 --> 03:01.460
are one.

03:03.620 --> 03:05.820
We have Anonymous as our common target.

03:06.290 --> 03:08.100
So we should work together.

03:14.510 --> 03:15.960
You've changed.

03:19.460 --> 03:20.960
Maybe this is the real me.

03:22.470 --> 03:24.840
Since you have found out my real identity,

03:26.840 --> 03:28.570
I'm just being honest with you.

03:37.780 --> 03:38.920
Do you like it?

03:50.390 --> 03:51.480
These flower buds

03:52.930 --> 03:54.790
seem like they're about to bloom.

03:57.780 --> 03:59.020
You'll know soon

04:00.280 --> 04:01.640
whether I like it or not.

04:11.270 --> 04:12.400
Lord Sword Wielder.

04:17.420 --> 04:18.820
I'm looking for Miss Yun.

04:23.450 --> 04:24.460
Can I trust

04:24.900 --> 04:26.160
the guardian's words?

04:26.830 --> 04:27.690
I can't be sure.

04:28.110 --> 04:29.110
He did drink then,

04:29.770 --> 04:31.830
but he insisted that he wasn't drunk.

04:39.330 --> 04:40.060
What is this?

04:40.460 --> 04:41.240
It's a new medicine

04:41.240 --> 04:42.700
that Elder Yue developed,

04:42.750 --> 04:43.680
the truth grass.

04:44.330 --> 04:45.260
After taking it,

04:45.490 --> 04:47.350
it can make people tell the truth.

04:48.620 --> 04:49.460
Is this what

04:49.520 --> 04:51.520
cleared Miss Yun of her suspicions?

04:55.060 --> 04:56.790
Why did Elder Yue give you this?

04:57.540 --> 04:59.120
How could he have given me this?

04:59.120 --> 05:00.020
I stole it.

05:09.180 --> 05:09.910
Originally,

05:10.740 --> 05:13.400
I just wanted to use this to probe Gong Shangjue.

05:13.890 --> 05:15.150
But now I suddenly feel

05:16.030 --> 05:17.020
that instead of investigating around

05:17.020 --> 05:18.950
without finding any useful clues,

05:19.240 --> 05:21.100
why not be more straightforward?

05:24.030 --> 05:24.890
Is there really

05:26.130 --> 05:29.530
a magical medicine that can control one's mind in this world?

05:31.150 --> 05:31.720
Yes.

05:33.530 --> 05:34.659
It's unbelievable.

05:38.340 --> 05:39.470
Why don't you try it?

05:40.690 --> 05:42.090
Do you have a conscience?

05:42.500 --> 05:43.670
It's not bad for your health.

05:43.670 --> 05:45.930
Just sacrifice yourself and cooperate.

05:47.370 --> 05:48.030
Take it now.

06:14.110 --> 06:14.970
How do you feel?

06:25.290 --> 06:26.490
I feel a little dizzy.

06:26.900 --> 06:27.450
So soon?

06:28.770 --> 06:30.570
I'll start the questioning now.

06:35.140 --> 06:35.670
Do you...

06:37.909 --> 06:39.320
like Gong Zishang?

06:42.790 --> 06:43.400
Tell me.

06:47.130 --> 06:48.060
I don't like her.

06:48.690 --> 06:49.570
Really?

06:52.320 --> 06:53.920
This medicine doesn't work.

06:54.190 --> 06:54.790
It's fake?

06:54.840 --> 06:55.470
It's fake.

06:56.120 --> 06:56.880
Do you mean

06:57.600 --> 07:00.730
that it's fake when you said you don't like Gong Zishang?

07:02.280 --> 07:03.140
You like my sister...

07:03.140 --> 07:03.900
Gong Ziyu.

07:07.030 --> 07:10.030
Every time you call me by my full name, I get flustered.

07:13.940 --> 07:15.280
If this medicine is fake,

07:15.280 --> 07:17.570
does that mean that what Miss Yun said then

07:17.570 --> 07:18.660
cannot be trusted?

07:19.930 --> 07:20.620
Do you...

07:21.920 --> 07:22.870
like me?

07:24.210 --> 07:24.970
No.

07:26.480 --> 07:27.070
Right.

07:31.900 --> 07:33.960
How can you smile after knowing that?

07:34.840 --> 07:35.490
Are you

07:36.310 --> 07:38.260
a Wufeng spy?

07:40.070 --> 07:40.780
No.

07:43.180 --> 07:43.909
Elder Yue

07:44.310 --> 07:45.510
was seen by a guardian

07:45.550 --> 07:47.720
when he went to the prison to meet the Wufeng assassin.

07:47.720 --> 07:50.180
Miss Yun is also suspected to be from Wufeng.

07:50.909 --> 07:54.170
Elder Yue used fake medicine to get Miss Yun out of trouble.

07:54.360 --> 07:54.820
This...

07:55.170 --> 07:56.430
I suddenly remembered

07:57.510 --> 07:58.810
that there is a secret room

07:58.810 --> 07:59.940
in Elder Yue’s room.

08:00.830 --> 08:01.890
In the secret room,

08:02.510 --> 08:05.070
there are traces that indicate that a woman had lived there.

08:05.070 --> 08:06.130
I've never heard of

08:06.390 --> 08:08.990
any woman who'd lived in Yue Residence before.

08:09.140 --> 08:10.200
In the secret room,

08:10.300 --> 08:11.760
there was also a bracelet.

08:11.960 --> 08:12.620
A bracelet?

08:14.120 --> 08:16.320
What's so special about that bracelet?

08:18.110 --> 08:18.790
Yun Que.

08:19.770 --> 08:20.300
Yun Que?

08:23.410 --> 08:25.260
On the ring Miss Yun carries around,

08:25.260 --> 08:26.520
there's also a Yun Que.

08:26.870 --> 08:27.380
Oh no.

08:27.630 --> 08:28.360
My necklace!

08:32.780 --> 08:35.150
Are you sure the person who the guardian saw

08:35.150 --> 08:36.179
was Elder Yue?

08:36.700 --> 08:37.270
No.

08:38.679 --> 08:41.080
He said that person was wearing a plain robe

08:41.299 --> 08:43.830
and there was a faint cloud pattern on his hem.

08:56.810 --> 08:59.010
Deep yearning and a myriad of emotions.

09:00.970 --> 09:03.030
I'll wait for you at the Yu residence.

09:12.750 --> 09:15.060
Deep yearning and a myriad of emotions.

09:17.120 --> 09:19.920
Walk out of the West Pavilion and speak with words.

09:29.160 --> 09:31.220
I'll wait for you at the Yu residence.

09:44.740 --> 09:46.870
She has an appointment with Elder Yue.

09:54.240 --> 09:56.470
[Jue]

10:14.740 --> 10:16.540
This is what a servant should do.

10:17.330 --> 10:18.290
Miss Shangguan.

10:19.070 --> 10:19.870
Don’t bother.

10:22.260 --> 10:23.940
How did you know it's me?

10:24.320 --> 10:26.320
Everyone's gait in terms of rhythm,

10:27.870 --> 10:29.300
heaviness and pace,

10:30.690 --> 10:31.550
scent,

10:33.020 --> 10:33.880
and breathing,

10:34.840 --> 10:35.940
are different.

10:37.160 --> 10:38.820
You must have trained before.

10:44.820 --> 10:46.440
When I was in the Gushan Sect,

10:47.030 --> 10:50.160
I learned some basic martial arts skills from my father.

10:50.640 --> 10:52.110
As for the kind of training

10:52.870 --> 10:54.400
that you're talking about,

10:54.740 --> 10:56.340
I haven't experienced that.

11:15.240 --> 11:16.640
Are you fully recovered?

11:17.110 --> 11:19.040
I think all the wounds have healed.

11:19.820 --> 11:21.820
There wasn't much scarring either.

11:27.450 --> 11:28.250
Young Master.

11:28.810 --> 11:30.210
Do you want to take a look?

11:56.010 --> 11:57.410
I won't disturb you then.

12:05.260 --> 12:06.390
This hot spring bath

12:07.570 --> 12:09.210
is good for healing the skin.

12:11.330 --> 12:12.460
Do you want to try it?

13:19.770 --> 13:20.300
Miss Yun.

13:20.860 --> 13:22.230
We're preparing the soothing and insect-repelling incense

13:22.230 --> 13:23.430
for after lights out.

13:23.650 --> 13:24.580
Why are you here?

13:25.270 --> 13:27.960
Lord Sword Wielder and I just came back from the mountain.

13:27.960 --> 13:31.000
The Yue residence has a high level of water vapor and is cold and humid.

13:31.000 --> 13:33.500
Add some Chinese mugwort in the incense tonight

13:33.500 --> 13:34.960
to get rid of the humidity.

13:35.310 --> 13:37.200
These incense will be hung outside.

13:37.200 --> 13:38.800
I'm afraid it won't be effective.

13:38.800 --> 13:40.600
Why don't we just add some Chinese mugwort incense

13:40.600 --> 13:42.310
directly in the Sword Wielder's room?

13:42.310 --> 13:42.940
Hmm...

13:43.800 --> 13:44.730
That's fine too.

13:45.140 --> 13:47.870
Go get some Chinese mugwort from the storehouse.

13:48.570 --> 13:48.940
Yes.

13:54.990 --> 13:56.320
You should go along too.

13:56.470 --> 13:57.560
Get more.

13:57.890 --> 13:59.640
Put a pot of it in my room too.

13:59.930 --> 14:00.460
Yes.

14:43.410 --> 14:44.130
It's so late

14:44.610 --> 14:46.540
and he didn't even bring a lantern.

14:46.540 --> 14:50.140
He even brought so many guardians equipped with sabers with him.

14:50.240 --> 14:51.500
Where is Jin Fan going?

15:18.140 --> 15:19.140
The Yu residence?

15:19.290 --> 15:20.420
It's his territory.

15:21.580 --> 15:23.040
Why is he sneaking around?

15:30.780 --> 15:31.580
Incense?

16:46.240 --> 16:48.840
As expected, you really understood that poem.

16:51.740 --> 16:54.030
Deep yearning and a myriad of emotions.

16:56.300 --> 16:58.040
Using this to ask me out,

16:58.990 --> 17:00.080
what is it you want to ask?

17:00.080 --> 17:02.010
Why do you have Yun Que's bracelet?

17:13.150 --> 17:14.180
You know Yun Que?

17:17.430 --> 17:18.690
Your foster sister...

17:19.869 --> 17:21.030
is the person I love.

17:23.359 --> 17:25.020
Yun Que once told me about you.

17:26.700 --> 17:28.700
She said that you are the only person

17:28.710 --> 17:30.510
that's nice to her in this world.

17:31.090 --> 17:32.690
She showed me your portrait.

17:33.570 --> 17:34.240
So,

17:35.440 --> 17:36.910
I recognized you

17:38.000 --> 17:39.200
the first time we met.

17:49.280 --> 17:51.010
Since you knew I'm from Wufeng,

17:53.750 --> 17:55.480
why did you use fake truth grass

17:55.560 --> 17:56.890
to help me out secretly?

18:04.220 --> 18:05.900
How did Yun Que die?

18:08.400 --> 18:10.460
Was Yun Que killed by the Gong family?

18:29.510 --> 18:30.100
Sword Wielder.

18:30.100 --> 18:31.230
You're from Wufeng.

18:35.680 --> 18:36.650
Don't talk to me.

19:03.180 --> 19:04.440
How dare you attack me?

19:04.590 --> 19:05.830
This is insubordination.

19:05.830 --> 19:06.980
How bold of you!

19:07.300 --> 19:08.770
As a guardian of the Yu residence,

19:08.770 --> 19:09.730
it's my duty.

19:10.830 --> 19:13.760
How are you not poisoned by the poison of the incense?

19:14.690 --> 19:16.690
You did take the Herb Elixir indeed.

19:18.220 --> 19:20.220
How could a mere Green Jade Guardian

19:20.340 --> 19:22.720
have the right to obtain the Herb Elixir?

19:24.860 --> 19:26.790
I knew you were suspicious.

19:27.490 --> 19:29.150
This time, old and new grudges

19:29.650 --> 19:31.450
will be accounted for together.

19:32.380 --> 19:34.510
I'm afraid the roof of the Yu residence

19:34.800 --> 19:36.620
will be overturned this time.

19:41.660 --> 19:43.260
This is the outfit you chose.

19:44.310 --> 19:45.110
Do I look good?

19:48.580 --> 19:50.310
I'm not looking at the clothes.

20:01.100 --> 20:01.790
Actually,

20:03.260 --> 20:04.590
I came here late at night

20:05.420 --> 20:06.620
to ask you for a favor.

20:11.660 --> 20:12.590
What do you want?

20:15.690 --> 20:17.420
Please help me take my revenge.

20:24.390 --> 20:25.390
Who is your enemy?

20:29.010 --> 20:30.610
Dianzhu from Qingfeng Sect.

20:39.770 --> 20:43.050
You took on someone else's identity and sneaked into the Gong residence.

20:43.050 --> 20:44.510
Despite numerous crises,

20:45.060 --> 20:47.460
you've always managed to turn them around.

20:48.570 --> 20:50.830
With your intelligence and capability,

20:51.640 --> 20:53.570
why don't you take revenge yourself?

20:53.570 --> 20:54.120
I tried.

20:55.650 --> 20:56.510
More than once.

21:00.820 --> 21:03.090
It seems that the results were unsatisfactory.

21:03.090 --> 21:05.620
Our Shangguan family is a family of medicine.

21:05.750 --> 21:07.210
We know a lot about poison.

21:09.010 --> 21:11.070
I've received almost all the poisons

21:11.450 --> 21:13.460
that came from the Gong residence into the martial world.

21:13.460 --> 21:14.450
And I know

21:15.370 --> 21:18.230
that your most powerful poisons and hidden weapons

21:19.490 --> 21:21.020
are always for personal use

21:21.190 --> 21:22.250
and never for sale.

21:25.560 --> 21:26.380
That's true.

21:29.450 --> 21:30.600
You have a poison

21:30.980 --> 21:32.040
called Ascension.

21:32.910 --> 21:33.970
I used it as the base

21:34.580 --> 21:36.280
for other potent poisons to be mixed in

21:36.280 --> 21:37.750
such that it's incurable.

21:39.300 --> 21:41.440
In the Martial World Assembly two years ago,

21:41.440 --> 21:43.100
I disguised myself to blend in

21:43.860 --> 21:45.270
and secretly put poison

21:45.310 --> 21:46.370
in Dianzhu's food.

21:50.010 --> 21:53.500
Two years ago, the incident of Dianzhu being poisoned by a strange poison

21:53.500 --> 21:54.570
shocked the world.

21:56.320 --> 21:57.450
It was actually you.

21:59.550 --> 22:00.290
It was me.

22:01.970 --> 22:02.720
After that,

22:03.100 --> 22:03.940
I've been waiting

22:03.940 --> 22:07.140
for the news of Dianzhu's death to spread in the martial world.

22:07.140 --> 22:08.740
I waited for more than a month

22:09.590 --> 22:12.120
but Dianzhu actually reappeared unscathed.

22:12.430 --> 22:14.160
I really couldn't understand.

22:18.120 --> 22:19.920
If he was poisoned by Ascension,

22:21.590 --> 22:24.670
unless he had the exclusive antidote from the Gong family,

22:24.670 --> 22:25.310
he

22:26.610 --> 22:27.610
should have died.

22:29.820 --> 22:30.700
Not to mention

22:31.710 --> 22:34.440
how you had mixed in so many other potent poisons.

22:35.620 --> 22:37.680
Even a deity couldn't have saved him.

22:39.590 --> 22:40.300
Unless...

22:40.300 --> 22:42.240
Unless right after Dianzhu got poisoned,

22:42.240 --> 22:44.570
he took the Gong family's secret medicine

22:45.070 --> 22:46.730
and panacea, the Herb Elixir.

22:59.270 --> 22:59.880
Elder Yue.

23:00.740 --> 23:02.950
You are a high-ranking member of the Gong family.

23:02.950 --> 23:04.880
Why did you betray the Gong family?

23:10.550 --> 23:11.680
Lord Sword Wielder.

23:12.340 --> 23:13.730
Since I was born,

23:13.910 --> 23:15.430
I've been living deep in the back hill.

23:15.430 --> 23:17.990
I've never wandered around the martial world.

23:17.990 --> 23:19.720
I can't be a person from Wufeng.

23:20.800 --> 23:23.200
I have no intention to hurt the Gong family.

23:24.310 --> 23:25.150
But indeed,

23:26.770 --> 23:27.770
I did help Wufeng.

23:29.160 --> 23:30.360
About what happened,

23:30.870 --> 23:32.870
as long as you're willing to listen,

23:34.840 --> 23:36.300
I'll tell you everything.

23:40.190 --> 23:40.700
Say it.

23:43.220 --> 23:44.180
Two years ago,

23:45.150 --> 23:47.900
Wufeng sent someone to sneak into the Gong residence

23:47.900 --> 23:49.830
and tried to steal the Herb Elixir.

23:51.010 --> 23:52.420
Do you remember that?

23:53.660 --> 23:54.520
Of course.

23:55.930 --> 23:56.660
That person

23:58.780 --> 23:59.580
was Yun Que.

24:06.180 --> 24:07.640
Enter the Gong residence?

24:08.700 --> 24:09.120
Yes.

24:10.970 --> 24:12.030
It's not that easy.

24:13.130 --> 24:15.970
The container used to transport herbs in the Gong residence is very small.

24:15.970 --> 24:17.230
It can't hide a person.

24:18.150 --> 24:19.550
But you're an exception.

24:19.770 --> 24:21.560
The Muscle Shrinking Technique you practice

24:21.560 --> 24:23.490
can shrink your muscles and bones.

24:25.290 --> 24:26.110
It must be you.

24:38.110 --> 24:38.910
Young Master.

24:39.730 --> 24:42.060
Here's the seashell powder you asked for.

24:43.340 --> 24:44.430
Chuyun Chonglian

24:44.660 --> 24:47.390
has always only existed as in legends.

24:48.150 --> 24:50.880
I didn't expect you'd succeed in cultivating it.

24:51.450 --> 24:53.270
Chuyun Chonglian has been extinct for years.

24:53.270 --> 24:55.880
Only in the thick freezing soil back then

24:56.360 --> 24:59.020
are there still seedlings that were scattered.

24:59.320 --> 25:01.150
I've sent people to look for them for years,

25:01.150 --> 25:02.550
but I've only found a few.

25:03.550 --> 25:05.210
It was tended to for a long time

25:05.210 --> 25:07.270
before a flower has finally bloomed.

25:07.350 --> 25:08.460
You just said that Gong Yuanzhi

25:08.460 --> 25:10.080
successfully cultivated the Chuyun Chonglian.

25:10.080 --> 25:11.140
Are you lying to me?

25:11.680 --> 25:12.330
No.

25:13.630 --> 25:15.160
I knew you'd be interested.

25:15.440 --> 25:17.290
The already extinct magical flower

25:17.290 --> 25:19.370
has really been successfully cultivated.

25:19.370 --> 25:21.500
He must have put a lot of effort into it.

25:21.700 --> 25:23.170
No wonder they keep saying

25:23.500 --> 25:24.390
that a rare herb genius has appeared

25:24.390 --> 25:26.590
in the front hill of the Gong residence.

25:28.590 --> 25:30.650
I'd like to see the Chuyun Chonglian.

25:31.150 --> 25:33.940
I also want to meet this young Young Master Yuanzhi.

25:33.940 --> 25:34.800
You can't go.

25:36.300 --> 25:37.630
According to the rules,

25:37.890 --> 25:40.290
we can't leave the back hill even for a step.

25:41.340 --> 25:42.750
You are so bad.

25:42.850 --> 25:44.930
You said something that made him itch

25:45.060 --> 25:46.690
and yet forbid him to leave the back hill.

25:46.690 --> 25:47.770
I'm just honest.

25:48.060 --> 25:49.460
I'm just speaking facts.

25:49.700 --> 25:52.500
Aren't you busy with your research of Drunk Blood?

25:53.140 --> 25:56.670
Why do you still have the time to care about the front hill's matters?

25:56.670 --> 25:57.490
In my opinion,

25:57.830 --> 25:59.050
the Gong residence is the Gong residence.

25:59.050 --> 26:03.050
We should be allowed to go wherever, be it the front hill or the back hill.

26:09.360 --> 26:12.180
[Clinic]

28:08.070 --> 28:10.470
After Yun Que's whereabouts were exposed,

28:11.140 --> 28:12.020
she was immediately

28:12.020 --> 28:15.550
encircled and pursued by everyone from the front hill of the Gong residence.

28:15.550 --> 28:16.760
That was the night

28:18.260 --> 28:19.240
I met Yun Que.

28:22.650 --> 28:24.750
That night was the first time I disobeyed the ancestral precept

28:24.750 --> 28:26.550
and sneaked out of the back hill.

28:26.780 --> 28:27.710
I was going to take a look

28:27.710 --> 28:30.640
at the Chuyun Chonglian cultivated by Gong Yuanzhi.

28:31.450 --> 28:33.380
But I ended up running into Yun Que.

28:34.580 --> 28:36.700
It was the first time I saw the outside world,

28:36.700 --> 28:39.490
and I was curious and kind about everything.

28:41.280 --> 28:42.730
Back then, I didn't know

28:43.340 --> 28:44.830
who that injured girl was.

28:45.710 --> 28:47.710
So I brought the unconscious Yun Que

28:48.230 --> 28:49.960
directly back to the back hill.

28:51.570 --> 28:54.770
Did the Wufeng sneak into the Gong residence two years ago

28:55.170 --> 28:57.450
to help Dianzhu steal the Herb Elixir?

28:59.320 --> 29:00.940
That's exactly the same time.

29:00.940 --> 29:03.800
Although Qingfeng Sect has surrendered to Wufeng,

29:04.760 --> 29:06.150
it's just Dianzhu.

29:07.660 --> 29:11.790
Wufeng wouldn't have gone to such great lengths to steal medicine for her.

29:14.870 --> 29:17.070
Unless Dianzhu has a special identity.

29:20.350 --> 29:21.020
Otherwise,

29:22.790 --> 29:26.120
Wufeng wouldn't have provoked the Gong family that easily.

29:35.660 --> 29:36.390
You're back.

29:37.260 --> 29:37.680
Yes.

29:39.030 --> 29:40.890
You went to see Dianzhu this time.

29:40.980 --> 29:41.690
How is she?

29:42.330 --> 29:44.130
The chief is severely poisoned.

29:44.530 --> 29:47.660
She can only suppress the poison with her internal skill for now.

29:47.660 --> 29:49.390
I don't think she'll last long.

29:50.980 --> 29:51.900
I came back

29:51.900 --> 29:54.700
to attend the Chief Assembly on behalf of my chief.

29:55.290 --> 29:57.160
Have you found the person who poisoned her?

29:57.160 --> 29:58.580
Chief suspects

29:59.860 --> 30:00.490
Zhuo Mei.

30:21.100 --> 30:23.520
The Chief Assembly is held every half a month

30:23.520 --> 30:25.580
and there had never been an omission.

30:26.420 --> 30:28.880
But it was cancelled for no reason that time.

30:29.900 --> 30:32.220
After Elder Yue scolded me harshly,

30:33.870 --> 30:34.800
he handed Yun Que

30:35.350 --> 30:37.220
over to the former Sword Wielder to be dealt with.

30:37.220 --> 30:38.390
So my foster sister

30:40.240 --> 30:42.300
was really killed by the Gong family?

30:42.680 --> 30:43.390
No.

30:45.470 --> 30:46.370
At that time,

30:47.260 --> 30:49.860
I was researching the anesthetic Drunk Blood.

30:52.070 --> 30:53.980
So I proposed to Elder Yue

30:55.340 --> 30:57.190
and asked if I could use Yun Que

30:57.420 --> 30:58.550
as a medicine tester

30:58.870 --> 31:01.200
to test the medicine in the Yue residence.

31:03.730 --> 31:05.260
I know you think it's cruel.

31:07.950 --> 31:09.210
But if I didn't do that,

31:11.180 --> 31:13.110
Yun Que might have died that night.

31:23.220 --> 31:23.880
Who are you?

31:27.420 --> 31:28.820
Don't waste your energy.

31:31.980 --> 31:33.110
What did you do to me?

31:33.410 --> 31:35.340
Why is my internal skill depleted?

31:36.580 --> 31:37.290
Don't move.

31:39.600 --> 31:41.130
Don't try to use your power.

31:41.240 --> 31:42.900
It's not good for your health.

31:45.210 --> 31:46.540
Since you've caught me,

31:46.660 --> 31:48.190
I don't want to live either.

31:48.430 --> 31:49.490
Kill me if you want.

31:49.540 --> 31:50.940
It's useless to say more.

31:53.170 --> 31:54.220
We're not Wufeng.

31:54.830 --> 31:56.030
We're not that cruel.

31:57.520 --> 31:58.820
You're from the Gong residence.

31:58.820 --> 32:00.020
How dare you say that?

32:01.160 --> 32:03.170
What's wrong with people from the Gong residence?

32:03.170 --> 32:05.610
Have you never left the Gong residence before?

32:05.610 --> 32:06.450
In the martial world,

32:06.450 --> 32:07.900
everyone regards the people of the Gong residence

32:07.900 --> 32:09.100
as fierce and evil,

32:09.100 --> 32:10.630
and avoid them at all costs.

32:14.310 --> 32:15.000
Is that so?

32:18.340 --> 32:19.400
What place is this?

32:20.360 --> 32:21.070
It's a safe

32:21.740 --> 32:23.200
but also dangerous place.

32:29.280 --> 32:30.100
What is this?

32:30.480 --> 32:31.570
What else could it be?

32:31.570 --> 32:32.170
Medicine.

32:33.630 --> 32:34.690
As the last resort,

32:35.060 --> 32:36.720
you have to take your own life.

32:40.780 --> 32:43.780
Are you trying to kill yourself by biting your tongue?

32:44.390 --> 32:45.790
I disregarded my health

32:46.820 --> 32:48.970
and researched all kinds of detoxification methods

32:48.970 --> 32:51.740
and finally snatched you back from the depths of Hell.

32:51.740 --> 32:52.640
I hate people

32:53.230 --> 32:55.430
who don't cherish their lives the most.

32:56.340 --> 32:57.600
The dead won't suffer.

32:58.250 --> 33:00.910
The pain is left to those who will grieve for you.

33:03.310 --> 33:05.170
Those who seek death are cowards.

33:06.030 --> 33:07.680
Because they're transferring their pain

33:07.680 --> 33:08.940
to those who love them.

33:25.980 --> 33:26.900
Sister.

33:28.310 --> 33:28.860
I'm here.

33:31.710 --> 33:33.350
I'm leaving tomorrow.

33:39.170 --> 33:39.840
I know.

33:44.850 --> 33:46.250
Don’t listen to Hanya Si.

33:47.970 --> 33:49.430
Even if the mission fails,

33:50.310 --> 33:51.970
you must find a way to survive.

34:14.440 --> 34:15.699
I told the Sword Wielder

34:15.699 --> 34:17.340
to make you my medicine tester

34:17.340 --> 34:18.800
to help me test my medicine

34:19.949 --> 34:21.380
so as to save your life.

34:22.760 --> 34:24.889
What medicine do you want to test on me?

34:25.929 --> 34:26.860
The Drunk Blood.

34:27.909 --> 34:28.440
A poison?

34:28.850 --> 34:29.480
No.

34:31.139 --> 34:33.340
It's an anesthetic that relieves pain.

34:36.730 --> 34:38.060
I like making antidotes

34:38.580 --> 34:39.639
and saving people.

34:41.159 --> 34:44.290
There are enough people in the Gong residence who can make poison.

34:44.290 --> 34:46.290
They can do without one more like me.

34:51.139 --> 34:53.100
So I won't die from drinking it?

34:54.139 --> 34:54.940
No, you won't.

34:57.610 --> 34:58.280
But

34:59.120 --> 34:59.980
you'll suffer.

35:02.840 --> 35:04.440
I'm not even afraid of death.

35:04.960 --> 35:06.890
Why would I be afraid of suffering?

35:17.190 --> 35:18.850
Don't keep mentioning death.

35:19.710 --> 35:20.910
You must live on well.

35:29.620 --> 35:31.020
Don’t listen to Hanya Si.

35:31.470 --> 35:32.930
Even if the mission fails,

35:33.800 --> 35:35.460
you must find a way to survive.

36:05.760 --> 36:06.560
You're awake.

36:15.670 --> 36:17.500
A few days ago, after taking the medicine,

36:17.500 --> 36:19.830
your muscles became tense and you lost your consciousness.

36:19.830 --> 36:20.900
I felt your pulse

36:21.340 --> 36:22.940
and realized it was chaotic.

36:28.460 --> 36:30.390
At first, I didn't know the reason.

36:30.540 --> 36:31.430
Then I guessed

36:32.060 --> 36:33.650
that it was because you were forced

36:33.650 --> 36:36.000
to practice the Muscle Shrinking Technique since you were little.

36:36.000 --> 36:38.900
You were often confined in narrow spaces over a long period of time,

36:38.900 --> 36:40.430
so you felt claustrophobic

36:40.500 --> 36:41.630
in a confined space.

36:42.290 --> 36:42.900
So

36:43.290 --> 36:44.750
I moved you out of the room.

36:57.260 --> 36:58.940
I'm just your medicine tester.

36:58.940 --> 37:00.540
You don't have to care for me.

37:04.430 --> 37:06.560
I need my medicine tester to be healthy

37:06.670 --> 37:08.270
in order to test my medicine.

37:09.740 --> 37:10.810
I'm just your tool.

37:11.840 --> 37:12.570
I'm outside,

37:12.640 --> 37:14.410
but I'll still be tortured by you.

37:14.410 --> 37:15.670
There's a difference.

37:17.430 --> 37:18.690
When I'm torturing you,

37:18.690 --> 37:19.620
I'll be happier.

37:42.090 --> 37:43.950
I didn't know what you like to eat,

37:44.550 --> 37:46.150
so I just brought what I like.

37:47.090 --> 37:48.490
Does it suit your tastes?

37:49.050 --> 37:49.630
No.

37:52.300 --> 37:53.310
That's too bad.

37:53.980 --> 37:55.030
You just have to eat

37:55.030 --> 37:55.930
whatever I eat.

37:57.680 --> 37:59.010
Then why are you asking?

38:01.060 --> 38:02.860
I just wanted to be polite to you.

38:03.620 --> 38:06.270
After all, I'm a knowledgeable and sensible person.

38:06.270 --> 38:07.400
If you don't like it,

38:07.890 --> 38:09.090
I can change my style.

38:14.460 --> 38:15.590
It's not poisonous.

38:27.820 --> 38:28.220
Look.

38:30.510 --> 38:30.910
You...

38:31.580 --> 38:32.490
It tastes good.

38:35.590 --> 38:37.850
I won't eat it even if it's not poisonous.

38:40.320 --> 38:42.670
If you want to protest with a hunger strike,

38:42.670 --> 38:45.000
then I can only mash up the food and feed you

38:45.030 --> 38:46.690
like how I treat cats and dogs.

38:48.180 --> 38:49.440
Do you like this style?

38:53.510 --> 38:56.110
A medicine tester is worse off than a cat or dog.

38:56.140 --> 38:58.200
Cats are much more obedient than you.

38:58.340 --> 38:59.270
What did you say?

39:00.090 --> 39:00.590
I said

39:00.990 --> 39:02.300
that this is really delicious.

39:02.300 --> 39:02.920
Try it.

39:07.990 --> 39:09.120
I'm just a medicine tester.

39:09.120 --> 39:10.850
Why do you care so much about me?

39:13.300 --> 39:14.760
Have you ever raised a pig?

39:15.860 --> 39:17.460
They have to be fed well

39:17.710 --> 39:19.770
before they can become pork rib soup.

39:20.780 --> 39:21.180
You...

39:39.060 --> 39:42.120
So you think it's dirty to use the chopsticks I've used.

40:04.310 --> 40:06.570
I didn't think too much about it at first.

40:07.920 --> 40:10.720
I planned to continue using her to test my medicine

40:11.700 --> 40:12.900
after she recovered.

40:15.170 --> 40:17.430
But after spending a long time together,

40:19.010 --> 40:20.250
I gradually grew

40:22.010 --> 40:24.070
to feel differently towards Yun Que.

40:47.850 --> 40:49.580
Why did you join Wufeng

40:49.850 --> 40:51.180
and become an assassin?

41:11.230 --> 41:12.760
Most people who join Wufeng

41:13.960 --> 41:15.360
don't know their origins

41:16.320 --> 41:17.780
and don't know where to go.

41:19.970 --> 41:21.430
A person who drifts around

41:22.050 --> 41:23.780
has a life like withered grass.

41:27.280 --> 41:30.560
They're usually orphans who have lost their parents when they were young

41:30.560 --> 41:31.730
and were taken in by Wufeng,

41:31.730 --> 41:33.660
and became used to obeying orders.

41:35.490 --> 41:36.900
Or they bear grudges

41:37.510 --> 41:39.310
that they can't reconcile with,

41:39.630 --> 41:43.230
so they want to take revenge with the help of the powerful Wufeng.

41:44.570 --> 41:45.630
Which type are you?

41:50.260 --> 41:52.390
Do you know what a coffin-born baby is?

41:55.640 --> 41:57.640
It's a baby who was born in the coffin

41:58.330 --> 41:59.990
of a deceased pregnant woman.

42:03.010 --> 42:03.810
That's right.

42:04.820 --> 42:06.160
I'm a coffin-born baby.

42:11.250 --> 42:12.870
An old beggar found me

42:14.130 --> 42:15.730
and saved me by getting me out

42:16.000 --> 42:17.130
and raised me.

42:21.620 --> 42:22.820
I called him Grandpa.

42:29.800 --> 42:31.310
One year on New Year's Eve,

42:32.860 --> 42:34.350
Grandpa saw some cold buns

42:35.890 --> 42:37.420
at the entrance of a tavern

42:38.890 --> 42:40.490
and wanted to give them to me.

42:42.110 --> 42:43.710
But he was regarded as a thief

42:45.660 --> 42:48.260
and beaten to death by some thugs in the tavern.

42:52.820 --> 42:53.550
At that time,

42:54.580 --> 42:57.380
I was biting onto the thug's hand with all my might.

42:59.540 --> 43:00.550
He called me a dog

43:03.110 --> 43:05.950
and beat me up so badly that I was bleeding from my head.

43:05.950 --> 43:07.100
But I didn't let go.

43:11.680 --> 43:12.400
Later,

43:14.650 --> 43:16.050
while I was barely breathing on the streets,

43:16.050 --> 43:17.650
someone from Wufeng saved me

43:19.540 --> 43:20.680
and took me back.

43:23.340 --> 43:24.010
That year,

43:25.280 --> 43:26.390
I was seven.

43:34.640 --> 43:35.590
In Wufeng,

43:37.120 --> 43:37.980
I was obedient,

43:38.380 --> 43:39.310
never rebelled,

43:40.400 --> 43:41.860
and made myself stronger.

43:43.020 --> 43:44.480
Only by being competitive

43:46.510 --> 43:49.240
was I able to survive in that dark place.

43:53.000 --> 43:54.830
I just wanted to stay alive.

44:02.040 --> 44:03.670
You're no longer in Wufeng.

44:04.810 --> 44:06.810
You don't have to be afraid anymore.

44:11.740 --> 44:13.140
I won't be able to escape.

44:26.380 --> 44:27.580
Wufeng has a medicine

44:28.150 --> 44:29.550
called Fortnight Flies.

44:39.700 --> 44:40.790
That was when

44:42.620 --> 44:45.550
I found out that the Fortnight Flies that Wufeng uses

44:45.900 --> 44:48.120
is the secret medicine specially made by the Gong family,

44:48.120 --> 44:49.580
the Heart Devouring Moon.

44:51.170 --> 44:53.170
Wufeng created the Fortnight Flies

44:53.190 --> 44:55.190
by modifying it to a certain degree,

44:55.270 --> 44:55.900
removing

44:55.920 --> 44:58.650
the poisonous element that forms a black line on the wrist,

44:58.650 --> 45:00.910
such that it became more inconspicuous.

45:01.300 --> 45:02.300
Although I don't know

45:02.300 --> 45:02.980
how Wufeng

45:02.980 --> 45:05.840
got the prescription for the Heart Devouring Moon,

45:07.950 --> 45:09.220
after I finished studying the Death Oath pill

45:09.220 --> 45:11.060
that Yun Que gave me,

45:15.620 --> 45:16.460
I was sure

45:17.930 --> 45:21.390
that that's the modified version of the Heart Devouring Moon.

45:58.470 --> 45:59.250
At first,

45:59.650 --> 46:01.100
Yun Que didn't trust me.

46:04.150 --> 46:05.970
It was only until I accompanied her

46:05.970 --> 46:09.830
through the most painful period of the Heart Devouring Moon's attack

46:10.220 --> 46:12.880
and her internal skill was increasing day by day

46:14.250 --> 46:15.850
that she finally trusted me.

46:19.460 --> 46:20.360
She told me

46:22.280 --> 46:23.810
that that was her first time

46:24.670 --> 46:28.130
she thought that she might be able to get out of Wufeng for good.

46:55.970 --> 46:57.360
Did you leave this piece of paper

46:56.240 --> 46:58.550
[I O U]

46:57.500 --> 46:58.410
on the desk?

47:02.540 --> 47:03.670
You want to thank me,

47:03.910 --> 47:05.440
but you're too shy to say it.

47:06.160 --> 47:07.890
So you gave me this word riddle?

47:10.170 --> 47:11.260
I, O, U.

47:11.640 --> 47:13.240
That sounds like "I owe you".

47:13.830 --> 47:14.960
You're thanking me.

47:20.060 --> 47:20.860
In Wufeng,

47:21.980 --> 47:23.980
amidst the endless cruel training,

47:25.170 --> 47:26.600
my only joy every day

47:28.970 --> 47:31.230
was playing word riddles with my sister.

47:31.390 --> 47:32.190
Your sister?

47:35.920 --> 47:37.520
We met at Wufeng.

47:39.580 --> 47:41.380
She took me as her foster sister.

47:47.060 --> 47:49.260
I remember when I wanted to kill myself,

47:49.770 --> 47:51.370
you said that I was cowardly.

47:51.680 --> 47:52.480
That by dying,

47:52.770 --> 47:56.170
I'm just transferring my pain to those who will grieve for me.

47:56.240 --> 47:58.240
At that time, the person I thought of

47:58.300 --> 47:59.220
was my sister.

48:04.740 --> 48:05.820
She has no family.

48:06.820 --> 48:07.550
Neither do I.

48:08.650 --> 48:09.890
Then, I was thinking

48:10.710 --> 48:11.850
that if I died,

48:13.570 --> 48:14.900
my sister would be alone

48:15.480 --> 48:16.840
and really sad.

48:20.580 --> 48:21.280
That's why

48:22.710 --> 48:24.640
I chose to be your medicine tester.

48:25.940 --> 48:27.800
You're in the Gong residence now.

48:28.420 --> 48:29.240
You're safe.

48:33.710 --> 48:34.950
I can't stay here.

48:37.700 --> 48:38.920
You don't like...

48:40.040 --> 48:41.500
You don't like this place?

48:50.620 --> 48:51.420
You're right.

48:52.740 --> 48:56.130
Having heard the numerous stories about your life in the martial world,

48:56.130 --> 48:57.190
I also yearn for it.

48:58.980 --> 49:01.380
I've been in this back hill since I was born.

49:02.580 --> 49:03.650
The days here

49:05.540 --> 49:06.610
are indeed boring.

49:07.980 --> 49:08.780
I understand.

49:11.020 --> 49:11.380
No.

49:12.640 --> 49:13.640
I like this place.

49:15.640 --> 49:16.820
If possible,

49:18.370 --> 49:20.230
I'm willing to stay here forever.

49:23.100 --> 49:24.110
Then stay.

49:25.510 --> 49:27.440
Stay here for the rest of your life.

49:35.680 --> 49:37.090
You don't know Wufeng.

49:39.610 --> 49:40.870
If I stay,

49:42.240 --> 49:44.040
it will only bring you disaster.

49:48.520 --> 49:49.650
I came here this time

49:50.340 --> 49:52.200
not only to steal the Herb Elixir,

49:52.740 --> 49:54.400
but also for another mission.

49:54.820 --> 49:55.700
What is it?

49:56.980 --> 49:58.240
To look for Anonymous.

50:00.890 --> 50:01.560
Anonymous?

50:03.560 --> 50:06.000
Anonymous is a Mei, who Wufeng hasn't heard from

50:06.000 --> 50:08.930
since they entered the Gong residence ten years ago.

50:10.450 --> 50:11.960
Wufeng won't let anyone

50:11.980 --> 50:14.900
who knows its inner workings to leave the organization.

50:14.900 --> 50:16.900
So they sent me here to look for them.

50:18.660 --> 50:19.820
If I stay,

50:20.680 --> 50:21.670
Wufeng will also

50:21.880 --> 50:23.620
keep sending assassins

50:23.660 --> 50:25.450
to the Gong residence to look for me.

50:25.450 --> 50:26.870
Regardless of if I'm dead or alive,

50:26.870 --> 50:28.200
they have to confirm it.

50:29.020 --> 50:32.080
Until then, the Gong residence will never be peaceful.

50:34.580 --> 50:35.870
It was also at that time

50:39.940 --> 50:41.200
that I said something

50:42.290 --> 50:44.090
that I regret the most in my life.

50:49.620 --> 50:50.300
What if

50:50.780 --> 50:52.640
we just let them witness a corpse?

51:00.070 --> 51:01.300
What happened

51:02.080 --> 51:04.080
to that Wufeng assassin after that?

51:06.050 --> 51:07.850
She was used as a medicine tester

51:08.720 --> 51:09.850
and died soon after.

51:13.070 --> 51:14.670
In order to threaten Wufeng,

51:15.650 --> 51:16.850
so that they won't

51:17.670 --> 51:20.530
easily sneak people into the Gong residence again,

51:23.260 --> 51:25.380
her corpse was hung on the city gate

51:27.940 --> 51:30.600
and exposed to the sun for three days and nights.

51:34.700 --> 51:35.740
I told Yun Que

51:37.440 --> 51:39.700
that the winter cicada grass I developed

51:40.060 --> 51:40.750
could turn a person into

51:40.750 --> 51:43.210
a state like a hibernating insect in winter.

51:44.010 --> 51:45.670
Your breathing and heartbeat

51:45.860 --> 51:46.760
are inhibited,

51:47.860 --> 51:49.600
and your skin turns completely pale.

51:49.600 --> 51:51.000
It's akin to a fake death.

51:53.510 --> 51:54.220
Later,

51:55.730 --> 51:58.190
I proposed to Elder Yue and the Sword Wielder

52:00.080 --> 52:01.430
to hang Yun Que's corpse

52:02.370 --> 52:04.500
on the Gong residence's city gate wall

52:05.420 --> 52:07.080
as a demonstration to Wufeng.

52:09.680 --> 52:11.880
The Sword Wielder agreed to my request.

52:20.580 --> 52:21.260
Drink this.

52:32.010 --> 52:33.470
This medicine is so sweet.

52:36.900 --> 52:38.420
This is the elixir I made

52:38.880 --> 52:41.020
with golden cicadas

52:41.060 --> 52:43.660
and the Snow Lotus Germ I asked Xue Chongzi for.

52:44.150 --> 52:45.730
It can guarantee that

52:45.810 --> 52:47.370
for three days and three nights,

52:47.370 --> 52:49.630
you won't die from starvation or thirst.

52:54.300 --> 52:55.300
Give me your hand.

53:00.160 --> 53:01.000
This ointment

53:01.520 --> 53:03.690
can help reduce the abrasions

53:04.230 --> 53:06.290
when you're tied up and hung by a rope.

53:07.150 --> 53:08.350
If a scar forms

53:08.520 --> 53:09.920
on such a beautiful hand,

53:10.370 --> 53:11.430
my heart will ache.

53:17.890 --> 53:19.220
Give me your other hand.

53:38.830 --> 53:41.210
My sister gave me that bracelet.

53:43.900 --> 53:46.330
I've never taken it off since I put it on.

53:49.630 --> 53:50.690
When you come back,

53:51.350 --> 53:52.880
I'll put it on for you again.

53:57.820 --> 53:58.980
I'll ask the Gong residence's

53:58.980 --> 54:01.060
best craftsman, Young Master Hua,

54:02.170 --> 54:04.210
to make a new bracelet for you.

54:06.290 --> 54:07.170
I'll carve

54:09.360 --> 54:10.560
a crescent moon on it.

54:14.020 --> 54:14.650
Okay.

54:32.310 --> 54:32.940
Later,

54:33.560 --> 54:34.520
Yun Que's corpse

54:34.940 --> 54:37.600
was hung on the Gong residence's city gate wall.

54:37.670 --> 54:38.570
As promised,

54:39.040 --> 54:40.630
on the third night,

54:40.740 --> 54:42.140
I'd bring the corpse down

54:42.840 --> 54:44.230
and fake a burial.

54:45.590 --> 54:46.580
Then,

54:47.630 --> 54:49.960
Yun Que will no longer exist in this world.

54:52.990 --> 54:53.590
Yun Que.

54:55.190 --> 54:57.190
You don't have to be afraid anymore.

54:59.240 --> 55:01.140
Then, she can live with me in the Yue residence

55:01.140 --> 55:02.710
for the rest of our lives.

55:03.740 --> 55:04.810
But I didn't expect

55:05.610 --> 55:06.940
that on the third night,

55:07.610 --> 55:09.470
when I went to the city gate tower,

55:10.840 --> 55:12.040
what I wished for

55:12.900 --> 55:14.140
actually came true.

55:15.610 --> 55:16.410
What's wrong?

55:17.100 --> 55:18.100
Young Master Yue.

55:18.320 --> 55:19.410
The assassin's corpse

55:19.410 --> 55:20.100
is gone.

55:51.570 --> 55:52.540
In this world,

55:55.330 --> 55:57.590
Yun Que really no longer exists anymore.

56:13.190 --> 56:18.500
♫The sun rises in the east and sets in the west♫

56:20.500 --> 56:25.540
♫Our parents call us home for dinner♫

56:27.870 --> 56:34.680
♫We grew up together♫

56:35.270 --> 56:40.670
♫We never wake up from our sweet dreams♫

56:40.220 --> 56:41.280
You're still here.

56:41.650 --> 56:48.440
♫Spring brews life, and Winter brews coldness♫

56:43.820 --> 56:45.260
But my Yun Que is gone.

56:49.030 --> 56:55.940
♫You're always in my thoughts♫

56:56.460 --> 57:03.690
♫Summer is long, and Autumn is brief♫

57:04.630 --> 57:10.330
♫I hope we can reunite again♫

57:13.500 --> 57:14.300
After that...

57:17.190 --> 57:18.650
I never saw Yun Que again.

57:20.720 --> 57:21.580
I have seen her.

57:27.360 --> 57:28.460
Yun Que's corpse

57:30.530 --> 57:31.860
was sent back to Wufeng.

57:38.120 --> 57:39.400
How did she die?

57:42.930 --> 57:46.590
She was killed by the Gong family's exclusive saber technique...

57:47.740 --> 57:49.600
in which her skull was smashed up.

58:12.920 --> 58:14.580
Are you sure you want to see it?

59:56.420 --> 59:57.480
Her body

59:58.860 --> 01:00:00.000
was reduced to mush.

01:00:04.070 --> 01:00:05.880
Her skull was chopped up.

01:00:10.860 --> 01:00:11.470
Elder Yue.

01:00:14.340 --> 01:00:16.940
On the night my father and brother were killed,

01:00:16.970 --> 01:00:18.230
did you go to the prison

01:00:18.540 --> 01:00:20.270
to look for the Wufeng assassin

01:00:20.710 --> 01:00:22.640
to find out about Yun Que?

01:00:33.690 --> 01:00:35.660
Then, I heard from the assassin

01:00:38.310 --> 01:00:39.990
that Yun Que was already dead.

01:00:42.300 --> 01:00:43.600
As you said,

01:00:47.070 --> 01:00:47.660
she...

01:00:50.370 --> 01:00:52.770
She was killed by having her skull smashed.

01:00:55.220 --> 01:00:57.530
So, was Yun Que killed by the Gong family?

01:00:58.370 --> 01:01:00.170
The people of the Gong residence

01:01:00.810 --> 01:01:02.470
wouldn't have killed Yun Que.

01:01:04.820 --> 01:01:07.480
I think when Wufeng retrieved Yun Que's corpse,

01:01:08.850 --> 01:01:11.580
they found out the secret of Yun Que's fake death.

01:01:29.150 --> 01:01:29.950
What's wrong?

01:01:30.830 --> 01:01:32.430
Is something bothering you?

01:01:36.460 --> 01:01:39.060
I just thought of an old friend who passed away.

01:01:50.050 --> 01:01:51.850
Today is her death anniversary.

01:02:22.710 --> 01:02:25.250
You did a good job in this mission.

01:02:26.140 --> 01:02:27.250
As a Chi,

01:02:28.030 --> 01:02:31.890
not only did you sneak into the Gong residence and get the Herb Elixir,

01:02:32.040 --> 01:02:33.840
but you also escaped unscathed.

01:02:34.560 --> 01:02:37.160
You're the first one to do so in all these years.

01:02:37.670 --> 01:02:39.800
Although when we retrieved your body,

01:02:39.980 --> 01:02:41.470
we thought you were dead.

01:02:42.800 --> 01:02:44.060
You've suffered.

01:02:51.410 --> 01:02:52.740
To complete my mission,

01:02:53.400 --> 01:02:55.400
any amount of suffering is worth it.

01:03:27.850 --> 01:03:29.850
Feigning death by taking medicine.

01:03:29.870 --> 01:03:31.660
You lied and put on a show.

01:03:32.220 --> 01:03:33.460
How ridiculous.

01:03:34.560 --> 01:03:35.480
Hanya Si.

01:03:36.090 --> 01:03:37.960
Carry her body down.

01:03:39.010 --> 01:03:40.230
Tell Yun Weishan

01:03:40.980 --> 01:03:42.830
the Gong family killed her.

01:03:47.730 --> 01:03:48.230
Yes.

01:03:59.510 --> 01:04:00.690
It's all your fault!

01:04:02.350 --> 01:04:03.590
It's all your fault!

01:04:04.660 --> 01:04:05.960
It's all your fault!

01:04:08.120 --> 01:04:09.450
It's all your fault!

01:04:15.520 --> 01:04:17.430
It's all your fault!

01:04:18.380 --> 01:04:20.390
You killed her!

01:04:21.290 --> 01:04:23.500
How did this happen?

01:04:27.660 --> 01:04:29.510
It's all your fault!

01:04:54.840 --> 01:05:00.640
♫The sun rises in the east and sets in the west♫

01:05:02.200 --> 01:05:08.240
♫Our parents call us home for dinner♫

01:05:09.510 --> 01:05:15.760
♫We grew up together♫

01:05:16.940 --> 01:05:22.030
♫We never wake up from our sweet dreams♫

01:05:23.280 --> 01:05:29.750
♫Spring brews life, and Winter brews coldness♫

01:05:30.720 --> 01:05:37.420
♫You're always in my thoughts♫

01:05:38.160 --> 01:05:45.280
♫Summer is long, and Autumn is brief♫

01:05:46.330 --> 01:05:52.130
♫I hope we can reunite again♫

01:05:52.320 --> 01:05:54.120
No!
